# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your Supabase project's values
# (Project Settings -> API in the Supabase dashboard).
#
# Without these, isSupabaseConfigured (src/lib/supabase.ts) is false and
# sign-in/sign-up are disabled app-wide — the auth widget shows
# "Sign-in coming soon" instead of the sign-in button.
#
# Also run supabase/schema.sql (SQL Editor -> New query) against that same
# project so the `profiles` table and its RLS policies exist — without it,
# sign-up will succeed but saving the profile/nickname will fail.
